  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "One of the longest-running frustrations among VRChat users is that the Worlds section is equivalent to the Wild West. AI-generated or otherwise misleading thumbnails, lacking descriptors, and tons of half-baked worlds to sift through, in order to find the polished ones.\n\nI'd like to propose:\n\nA \"Community Ranked\" 1-5 star experience rating system. Votes only taken from Trusted or Known users to ensure quality of the ratings and prevent the review-bombing of anyone's worlds. This would vastly decrease the time spent sifting through lower-quality content. Suggest that 1 infers a \"Very Poor\" experience, 2 infers \"Needs Improvement\", 3 is \"Acceptable\", etc.",
